tions/entrance/detections`.\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A detection request has valid `detectedObjectType` and `detectedAt` fields and, where applicable, a plate or failure reason.\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-8.3\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"The response status is 200 and the response body contains the verification identifier, office date and time, plate, verification, entry status, `greenActivationRequested`, and detail; invalid input has response status 400.\",\n     \"when\": \"The integration sends the request to `POST /integrations/entrance/detections`.\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A detection contains a failure reason or the verification service is unavailable.\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-8.4\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"The returned verification is fail-closed and requests no green activation; a verification-service outage has response status 503 and the response body conforms to `ApiError` with error code `service_unavailable`.\",\n     \"when\": \"The integration sends the detection to `POST /integrations/entrance/detections`.\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"An integration client submits a successful or unsuccessful detection.\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-8.5\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"A corresponding database row records the office date and time, plate when present, verification result, and entry status.\",\n     \"when\": \"The API processes the detection request.\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"An integration request lacks the required access token.\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-8.6\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"The response status is 401 and the response body conforms to `ApiError`.\",\n     \"when\": \"The API receives the detection request.\"\n    }\n   ],\n   \"anchors\": [\n    {\n     \"lineEnd\": 31,\n     \"lineStart\": 28,\n     \"path\": \"App.Api/Program.cs\",\n     \"quote\": \"app.MapGet(\\\"/\\\", () => \\\"API is up\\\").ExcludeFromDescription();\\n// The API's own docume